.TH XD\-JOY 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-joy \- Game Controllers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-joy
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-joy
is Windows XP's Game Controllers (Control Panel): the joysticks and
gamepads udev knows, kept current as they come and go.
Each one's Properties has XP's Test tab, live from its input device
(opened read-only and never grabbed, so games keep it), and a Settings
tab.
Calibration would need write access to the device, so it is only shown.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xd\-control (1)
